    "Disabled maps controllers 1-2 to normal PS2 ports. Port 1 Multitap maps controllers 1-4 to 1A/1B/1C/1D. Port 2 Multitap keeps controller 1 on Port 1 and maps controllers 2-4 to Port 2 multitap slots." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deaktiviert ordnet Controller 1-2 normalen PS2-Ports zu. Port-1-Multitap ordnet Controller 1-4 den Slots 1A/1B/1C/1D zu. Port-2-Multitap lässt Controller 1 auf Port 1 und ordnet Controller 2-4 den Multitap-Slots von Port 2 zu."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desactivado asigna los mandos 1-2 a puertos normales de PS2. Multitap puerto 1 asigna mandos 1-4 a 1A/1B/1C/1D. Multitap puerto 2 deja el mando 1 en puerto 1 y asigna mandos 2-4 al multitap del puerto 2."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Disattivato mappa i controller 1-2 alle normali porte PS2. Multitap porta 1 mappa i controller 1-4 su 1A/1B/1C/1D. Multitap porta 2 mantiene il controller 1 sulla porta 1 e mappa i controller 2-4 sugli slot multitap della porta 2."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desativado mapeia controles 1-2 para portas normais do PS2. Multitap porta 1 mapeia controles 1-4 para 1A/1B/1C/1D. Multitap porta 2 mantém o controle 1 na porta 1 e mapeia controles 2-4 para a porta 2."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时手柄 1-2 映射到普通 PS2 端口。端口 1 Multitap 将手柄 1-4 映射到 1A/1B/1C/1D。端口 2 Multitap 保留手柄 1 在端口 1，并将手柄 2-4 映射到端口 2 的 Multitap 插槽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
